WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.860
But I remember talking to him
once and being like, you know,

2
00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:10.210
you're 70-something, you
obviously made a lot of money,

3
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:15.200
enough money. Like, why not just
sell the Rondo and, you know,

4
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.350
enjoy life and go travel and have fun?

5
00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.510
And he kind of shared that
it wasn't about the money.

6
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:25.800
It never was about the money.
For him, it was the idea,

7
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:28.970
like we talked about
earlier, of hosting people.

8
00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:34.240
And when you take that away,
you take away who he was.
